# arm: D
# generate 25, keep 8: the curator chooses under real competition
# created 2026-08-13. Deltas from the base; everything unlisted falls through.
#
# Runs every day beside the base, into sync/Obsidian/Posts/D/.
# bin/arm.sh promote D folds these into profiles/base.env.

CURATE_DIRECTIVE=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/directives/tournament.md
MAX_NEW=25
MAX_LONG=3
MAX_SHORT=5
VERBATIM_MIN=55
NEW_SLACK_EVERY=6
GLUE_MAX_WORDS=20
GATE_TRACE=1
